      "type": "Comment",
      "x": 20,
      "y": -110,
      "params": {
        "text": "Rush a project to completion with gold (the @BUYME1 dialog). The cost is RECONSTRUCTED (the binary isn't in-repo to byte-decode it; see notes/rulings/RULINGS.md): a Formula over the hammers still needed, here build_remaining*8 gold, editable inline. 'Complete it' debits the treasury and finishes the building; 'Never mind' leaves it building normally."
